    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nMini.icons\n\n### Description\n\nI am trying to change htmldjango filetype icon, but it is still showing the default html icon or htmldjango files.\n\n### Neovim version\n\nNVIM v0.10.1 Build type: RelWithDebInfo LuaJIT 2.1.1720049189\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUsing lazy.nvim plugin manager\r\n```lua\r\nreturn {\r\n    \"echasnovski/mini.icons\",\r\n    lazy = true,\r\n    opts = {\r\n      file = {\r\n        [\".eslintrc.js\"] = { glyph = \"󰱺\", hl = \"MiniIconsYellow\" },\r\n        [\".node-version\"] = { glyph = \"\", hl = \"MiniIconsGreen\" },\r\n        [\".prettierrc\"] = { glyph = \"\", hl = \"MiniIconsPurple\" },\r\n        [\".yarnrc.yml\"] = { glyph = \"\", hl = \"MiniIconsBlue\" },\r\n        [\"eslint.config.js\"] = { glyph = \"󰱺\", hl = \"MiniIconsYellow\" },\r\n        [\"package.json\"] = { glyph = \"\", hl = \"MiniIconsGreen\" },\r\n        [\"tsconfig.json\"] = { glyph = \"\", hl = \"MiniIconsAzure\" },\r\n        [\"tsconfig.build.json\"] = { glyph = \"\", hl = \"MiniIconsAzure\" },\r\n        [\"yarn.lock\"] = { glyph = \"\", hl = \"MiniIconsBlue\" },\r\n      },\r\n      filetype = {\r\n        htmldjango = { glyph = \"==\", hl = \"MiniIconsBlue\" },\r\n      },\r\n    },\r\n    init = function()\r\n      ---@diagnostic disable-next-line: duplicate-set-field\r\n      package.preload[\"nvim-web-devicons\"] = function()\r\n        require(\"mini.icons\").mock_nvim_web_devicons()\r\n        return package.loaded[\"nvim-web-devicons\"]\r\n      end\r\n    end,\r\n    config = function(_, opts)\r\n      require(\"mini.icons\").setup(opts)\r\n    end,\r\n  }\r\n```\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nI expect the icon for htmldjango should be different from the actual html icon.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nThe default html icon is what is being shown.\r\n\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8143f4fc-d501-4606-b21a-3f693d804f37)\r\n",
